{
  "name": "angelia-of-signins",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/angelia-of-signins",
  "description": "Angelia of Signins: Sign-in log review from Entra ID, Okta or Google exports: password spraying from one address, failed-login bursts, legacy protocols, sign-ins from countries outside your list, the same account in two far-apart places, sign-in attempts on disabled accounts and service accounts used interactively. Names masked for the model. Drafts notes; never blocks an account.",
